Description: fix: mark client-rendered damage for backing first-frame gating
 During the window-map-to-first-client-frame window, the composite backing
 pixmap of an override-redirect window holds a CopyArea residue that must
 not be shown. Mark damage whose source is client rendering (clientMark
 set in damageDamageBox and Present) and flip _DDE_NET_WM_BACKING_PIXMAP_STATE
 from 0 to 1 when such content first reaches a Manual backing; the
 temporary Manual sensor is then unregistered.
Author: UnionTech <support@uniontech.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-09
---
